{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾推出多張個人專輯並為多部TVB劇集獻唱歌曲的鍾嘉欣，自2024年全面復出娛樂圈後，展開了《Remember 記得》巡迴演唱會。</p><p>她於昨日（20日）在社交平台發文，正式宣布將於明年進軍紅館開騷，喜訊一出隨即吸引大批圈中好友留言祝賀，亦獲逾萬網民讚好。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T05:20:05.553670+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T04:53:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T09:37:42.837933+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T05:17:37.673748+00:00","content_hash":"ea0f4d24af5752d4dc33e18a6e7cad53105761a5903fdd4a51dfd043762eddef","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}